  "lineage": "Formalized in Paris around 1998-2003 by La Peste and the Hangars Liquides label alongside Australia's Xanopticon and Japan's DJ Technorch, flashcore pushes hardcore techno past 300 BPM into rapid-fire clusters of resynthesized distorted kicks, granular micro-edits and abrupt silences, abandoning the steady four-on-the-floor pulse for arrhythmic, compositionally-structured bursts closer to musique concrete than dancefloor gabber.",
